WEBVTT

00:41:26.746 --> 00:41:30.538
And when you're doing that and then you
meet somebody else who's doing that,

00:41:30.996 --> 00:41:35.204
it's like really good timing, you know.
So in so many ways, it is the gift.

00:41:35.538 --> 00:41:38.496
You know, getting, Brian, is the gift of.

00:41:39.413 --> 00:41:45.288
Doing all of that laundry and searching
and finding and it's not the end of

00:41:45.288 --> 00:41:47.621
the story, of course, it's like
it wasn't like, well,

00:41:47.621 --> 00:41:49.371
now I'm just like all great
and everything.

00:41:49.371 --> 00:41:52.913
And and then, you know, 25 years later,
we're just here we are in the same place.

00:41:52.913 --> 00:41:56.329
I mean, we both struggled and grown and
gone through all kinds of things.

00:41:56.329 --> 00:42:00.663
Right. But, you know, to make yourself
ready for that kind of relationship,